# HTML dependency maintenance

The documentation template embeds the official jQuery 3.7.1 build from
https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js. Its jQuery 1.11.3 copy and the two
unreferenced jQuery 1.12.4 files in libs were removed in November 2026.
When regenerating HTML, update the R Markdown tools first and check the bundled
JavaScript versions before committing so that vulnerable copies do not return.
